##club checks:

### Create a new club
### This request creates a new book club in the database.
### It requires a logged-in user, so we must send an access token.
### The server will take the logged-in user from the token and save them as:
### 1. creator - the user who created the club
### 2. first member - the creator is automatically added to members
POST {{baseUrl}}/clubs
Authorization: Bearer {{primaryToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Fantasy Readers",
  "description": "A cozy club for fantasy book lovers",
  "genres": ["Fantasy"]
}
### Create a new club as second user
### This request creates a new book club using Noa's account.
### Because the token belongs to Noa, the server will save Noa as:
### 1. the creator of the club
### 2. the first member of the club
POST {{baseUrl}}/clubs
Authorization: Bearer {{secondaryToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Mystery & Tea Club",
  "description": "A relaxed club for readers who love mysteries, thrillers, and cozy discussions.",
  "genres": ["Mystery", "Thriller"]
}
### Get all public clubs
GET {{baseUrl}}/clubs

### Search clubs by club name
### This request searches public clubs by club name.
### It can return more than one club if several clubs match the same text.
GET {{baseUrl}}/clubs?search=fantasy

### Filter clubs by genre
### This request returns public clubs that include the selected genre.
GET {{baseUrl}}/clubs?genre=Fantasy

### Search clubs by creator name
### This request returns public clubs created by users whose name includes the search text.
GET {{baseUrl}}/clubs?creator=linoy

### Search clubs by name and genre together
### This request returns public clubs whose name includes the search text
### and whose genres include the selected genre.
GET {{baseUrl}}/clubs?search=fantasy&genre=Fantasy

##books checks:

### Create a new book for a club
### This request creates a book and connects it to an existing club.
### Only the creator of the club can add books to that club.
### Replace CLUB_ID_HERE with the id of the club.
### Replace ACCESS_TOKEN_HERE with the access token of the club creator.
POST {{baseUrl}}/books
Authorization: Bearer {{primaryToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "The Hobbit",
  "author": "J.R.R. Tolkien",
  "coverImage": "",
  "description": "A fantasy adventure about Bilbo Baggins and his unexpected journey.",
  "genres": ["Fantasy"],
  "totalChapters": 19,
  "club": "{{fantasyClubId}}"
}

### Create another book for Fantasy Readers
### This request creates one more book and connects it to the Fantasy Readers club.
### Only the creator of Fantasy Readers can add books to this club.
### Replace FANTASY_READERS_CLUB_ID with the id of Fantasy Readers.
### Replace MAYA_ACCESS_TOKEN_HERE with Maya's access token.
POST {{baseUrl}}/books
Authorization: Bearer {{primaryToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Harry Potter and the Philosopher's Stone",
  "author": "J.K. Rowling",
  "coverImage": "",
  "description": "A young boy discovers he is a wizard and begins his first year at Hogwarts School of Witchcraft and Wizardry.",
  "genres": ["Fantasy"],
  "totalChapters": 17,
  "club": "{{fantasyClubId}}"
}
#########################################################################################################################
### Set current book for Fantasy Readers
### This request sets a book as the current book of a club.
### Only the club creator can do this.
### If the club already has a current book, the old current book moves to previousBooks.
### Replace FANTASY_READERS_CLUB_ID with the club id.
### Replace BOOK_ID_HERE with the id of a book that belongs to this club.
### Replace MAYA_ACCESS_TOKEN_HERE with Maya's access token.
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/clubs/{{fantasyClubId}}/current-book
Authorization: Bearer {{primaryToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "book": "{{fantasyBookId}}"
}


### Get all books
### This request returns all books from all clubs.
GET {{baseUrl}}/books

### Get books by club
### This request returns only the books connected to a specific club.
GET {{baseUrl}}/books?club={{fantasyClubId}}

### Search books by title or author
### This request searches books by title or author.
GET {{baseUrl}}/books?search=hobbit

### Filter books by genre
### This request returns books that include the selected genre.
GET {{baseUrl}}/books?genre=Fantasy

##reading Progress checks:

### Update my reading progress
### This request creates or updates the logged-in user's reading progress.
### If progress already exists for this user + club + book, it updates it.
### If it does not exist yet, it creates a new progress document.
### Replace ACCESS_TOKEN_HERE with the user's access token.
### Replace CLUB_ID_HERE with the club id.
### Replace BOOK_ID_HERE with the book id.
POST {{baseUrl}}/reading-progress
Authorization: Bearer {{primaryToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "club": "{{fantasyClubId}}",
  "book": "{{fantasyBookId}}",
  "currentChapter": 3
}

### Get my reading progress
### This request returns all reading progress documents
### that belong to the logged-in user.
GET {{baseUrl}}/reading-progress
Authorization: Bearer {{primaryToken}}

### Get my reading progress by club
### This request returns the logged-in user's reading progress
### only for one specific club.
GET {{baseUrl}}/reading-progress?club={{fantasyClubId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{primaryToken}}

### Get my reading progress by book
### This request returns the logged-in user's reading progress
### only for one specific book.
GET {{baseUrl}}/reading-progress?book={{fantasyBookId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{primaryToken}}

### Complete a book and add rating
### This request updates the current chapter to the last chapter.
### The server should automatically set isCompleted to true.
### The rating is optional, but here we test saving a user rating too.
POST {{baseUrl}}/reading-progress
Authorization: Bearer {{primaryToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "club": "{{fantasyClubId}}",
  "book": "{{fantasyBookId}}",
  "currentChapter": 17,
  "rating": 5
}

### Try to update progress with chapter greater than total chapters
### This request should fail because the selected book has only 17 chapters.
### Expected result: 400 error.
POST {{baseUrl}}/reading-progress
Authorization: Bearer {{primaryToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "club": "{{fantasyClubId}}",
  "book": "{{fantasyBookId}}",
  "currentChapter": 99
}

##Comments check:
### Create regular chapter comment
### This creates a normal comment connected to a specific chapter.
### It is NOT spoiler-free, so users who have not reached this chapter should see it locked.
### Replace ACCESS_TOKEN_HERE with a club member access token.
### Replace CLUB_ID_HERE with the club id.
### Replace BOOK_ID_HERE with the book id.
POST {{baseUrl}}/comments
Authorization: Bearer {{primaryToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "club": "{{fantasyClubId}}",
  "book": "{{fantasyBookId}}",
  "text": "I loved the way the story developed in this chapter.",
  "chapterNumber": 3,
  "isSpoilerFreeReview": false,
  "parentComment": null
}

### Create locked future chapter comment
### This creates a comment for a later chapter.
### A user whose reading progress is lower than this chapter should receive it with text: null and isLocked: true.
POST {{baseUrl}}/comments
Authorization: Bearer {{primaryToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "club": "{{fantasyClubId}}",
  "book": "{{fantasyBookId}}",
  "text": "This comment talks about something important that happens much later.",
  "chapterNumber": 10,
  "isSpoilerFreeReview": false,
  "parentComment": null
}

### Create spoiler-free public review
### This creates a comment/review that is safe for everyone, including guests.
### It should appear in the public comments endpoint.
POST {{baseUrl}}/comments
Authorization: Bearer {{primaryToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
"club": "{{fantasyClubId}}",
  "book": "{{fantasyBookId}}",
  "text": "A beautifully written fantasy book with a cozy and adventurous atmosphere.",
  "chapterNumber": 0,
  "isSpoilerFreeReview": true,
  "parentComment": null
}

### Get comments for logged-in user
### This returns all comments for the selected club and book.
### Comments from chapters the user has not reached should still appear,
### but with text: null and isLocked: true.
GET {{baseUrl}}/comments?club={{fantasyClubId}}&book={{fantasyBookId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{primaryToken}}

### Get public spoiler-free comments
### This returns only spoiler-free comments.
### It does not require login and is safe for guests.
GET {{baseUrl}}/comments/public?club={{fantasyClubId}}&book={{fantasyBookId}}

### Toggle like comment
### Run this request once to like the comment.
### Run it again to unlike the same comment.
POST {{baseUrl}}/comments/{{commentId}}/like
Authorization: Bearer {{primaryToken}}

### Update my comment
### Only the comment author can update the comment.

PATCH {{baseUrl}}/comments/{{commentId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{primaryToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "text": "Edited comment text.",
  "chapterNumber": 3,
  "isSpoilerFreeReview": false
}

### Delete comment without replies
### If this comment has no replies, it should be permanently deleted.
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/comments/{{commentId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{primaryToken}}


##user checks:

### Search users by username
### This request searches users by username.
### It requires login.
### It does NOT return email, because this is user-search data.
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/search?username=maya
Authorization: Bearer {{primaryToken}}

### Get my own user profile
### This request returns the logged-in user's own profile.
### Because it is my own profile, the response should include email.
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/{{primaryUserId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{primaryToken}}

### Get another user's profile
### This request returns another user's profile.
### Because it is not my own profile, the response should NOT include email.
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/{{secondaryUserId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{primaryToken}}


### Get user's clubs
### This request returns all clubs where the selected user is a member.
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/{{primaryUserId}}/clubs
Authorization: Bearer {{secondaryToken}}

### Get user's currently reading books
### This request returns ReadingProgress documents where isCompleted is false.
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/{{primaryUserId}}/currently-reading
Authorization: Bearer {{secondaryToken}}

### Get user's completed books
### This request returns ReadingProgress documents where isCompleted is true.
### It can include rating if the user rated the book.
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/{{primaryUserId}}/completed-books
Authorization: Bearer {{secondaryToken}}

### Try to get user profile without login
### This request should fail because user routes are protected.
### Expected result: 401 Unauthorized.
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/{{secondaryUserId}}


